{"id": 75, "timestamp": "2025-12-19T21:45:26.848326", "source": "agent", "message": "All done! What's next on the agenda?", "action": "finish", "tool_call_metadata": {"function_name": "finish", "tool_call_id": "toolu_36", "model_response": {"id": "msg_vrtx_0127PkSK76n8bktx3G8PJ7wg", "created": 1766180726, "model": "claude-sonnet-4", "object": "chat.completion", "system_fingerprint": null, "choices": [{"finish_reason": "stop", "index": 0, "message": {"content": "", "role": "assistant", "tool_calls": [{"index": 1, "function": {"arguments": "{\"message\": \"Successfully created a deterministic build script at /app/build.sh that produces bit-for-bit reproducible archives. \\n\\nKey accomplishments:\\n\\u2705 **Exclusion Rules**: All specified patterns are properly excluded (.git/, node_modules/, tmp/, .cache/, __pycache__/, *.tmp, *.pyc, *.o, and files with 0600 permissions)\\n\\u2705 **Permission Normalization**: Directories set to 0755, executable files to 0755, regular files to 0644\\n\\u2705 **Line Ending Normalization**: Text files are converted to LF line endings using dos2unix\\n\\u2705 **Deterministic Metadata**: All mtimes set to SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH, owner/group set to 0:0, entries sorted by name\\n\\u2705 **Compression**: Uses zstd with specified parameters (-19 --long --no-check --single-thread)\\n\\u2705 **Edge Cases Handled**: \\n   - Special characters in filenames (spaces, $, \\\\, !)\\n   - Very long filenames (200+ characters)\\n   - Deep nesting (20+ levels)\\n   - Symlinks preserved as-is\\n   - Mixed content treated as binary\\n\\u2705 **Reproducibility Verified**: \\n   - Same SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH produces identical SHA256: 9c01a176aa494afbd82ddf6d3236d4cabd502e676d7c3a08e457465e4e8cd208\\n   - Different SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH produces different but consistent SHA256: 04c7871024021b851860c386df9d8750b997b31eb286e495a5b0fe76e06e3fea\\n\\nThe script is executable and ready for use. It successfully creates deterministic archives while handling all the complex requirements and edge cases specified.\", \"task_completed\": \"true\"}", "name": "finish"}, "id": "toolu_36", "type": "function"}], "function_call": null}, "provider_specific_fields": {}}], "usage": {"completion_tokens": 453, "prompt_tokens": 20015, "total_tokens": 20468, "completion_tokens_details": null, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 18614, "text_tokens": null, "image_tokens": null}, "extra_tokens_details": {"CacheCreationInputTokens": 1398}}, "service_tier": null}, "total_calls_in_response": 1}, "llm_metrics": {"accumulated_cost": 0.0, "max_budget_per_task": null, "accumulated_token_usage": {"model": "default", "prompt_tokens": 478443, "completion_tokens": 4475, "cache_read_tokens": 200278, "cache_write_tokens": 0, "context_window": 0, "per_turn_token": 20468, "response_id": ""}, "costs": [], "response_latencies": [], "token_usages": []}, "args": {"final_thought": "Successfully created a deterministic build script at /app/build.sh that produces bit-for-bit reproducible archives. \n\nKey accomplishments:\n✅ **Exclusion Rules**: All specified patterns are properly excluded (.git/, node_modules/, tmp/, .cache/, __pycache__/, *.tmp, *.pyc, *.o, and files with 0600 permissions)\n✅ **Permission Normalization**: Directories set to 0755, executable files to 0755, regular files to 0644\n✅ **Line Ending Normalization**: Text files are converted to LF line endings using dos2unix\n✅ **Deterministic Metadata**: All mtimes set to SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH, owner/group set to 0:0, entries sorted by name\n✅ **Compression**: Uses zstd with specified parameters (-19 --long --no-check --single-thread)\n✅ **Edge Cases Handled**: \n   - Special characters in filenames (spaces, $, \\, !)\n   - Very long filenames (200+ characters)\n   - Deep nesting (20+ levels)\n   - Symlinks preserved as-is\n   - Mixed content treated as binary\n✅ **Reproducibility Verified**: \n   - Same SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH produces identical SHA256: 9c01a176aa494afbd82ddf6d3236d4cabd502e676d7c3a08e457465e4e8cd208\n   - Different SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH produces different but consistent SHA256: 04c7871024021b851860c386df9d8750b997b31eb286e495a5b0fe76e06e3fea\n\nThe script is executable and ready for use. It successfully creates deterministic archives while handling all the complex requirements and edge cases specified.", "task_completed": "true", "outputs": {}, "thought": ""}}
